# @clara/infra: environment for the CDK CLI. Stack settings (NAT mode, sign-up
# restrictions, throttling and so on) are CDK context values, not environment variables:
# put them in packages/infra/cdk.context.json (gitignored) or pass -c key=value.
# See docs/configuration.md for the full list.

# The AWS profile to deploy with. CDK reads its account and region.
AWS_PROFILE=clara-admin

# Optional overrides. The CDK CLI normally fills these from the profile.
# CDK_DEFAULT_ACCOUNT=123456789012
# CDK_DEFAULT_REGION=eu-north-1
